  aes_sbox   — AES S-Box, SubBytes, ShiftRows, and AddRoundKey operations.
  chacha20   — ChaCha20 stream cipher core (quarter round, block, encrypt/decrypt).
  hash_chain — Hash chains & Merkle trees (FNV-1a style demo hashing).
